{"page":253,"width":2000,"height":2831,"text_angle":0,"lines":[{"text":"246","words":[{"text":"246","x":219,"y":144,"width":72,"height":36}]},{"text":"CHAPTER 03 • 트랜스포트 계층","words":[{"text":"CHAPTER","x":595,"y":144,"width":122,"height":26},{"text":"03","x":727,"y":146,"width":33,"height":25},{"text":"•","x":793,"y":153,"width":12,"height":12},{"text":"트랜스포트","x":837,"y":147,"width":128,"height":29},{"text":"계층","x":976,"y":145,"width":51,"height":30}]},{"text":"네트워크 지원 혼잡제어. 네트워크 지원 혼잡제어에서 네트워크 계층 구성요소는","words":[{"text":"네트워크","x":636,"y":274,"width":122,"height":34},{"text":"지원","x":774,"y":275,"width":60,"height":34},{"text":"혼잡제어.","x":850,"y":273,"width":131,"height":36},{"text":"네트워크","x":1002,"y":270,"width":133,"height":38},{"text":"지원","x":1155,"y":270,"width":64,"height":38},{"text":"혼잡제어에서","x":1237,"y":269,"width":204,"height":39},{"text":"네트워크","x":1464,"y":269,"width":139,"height":38},{"text":"계층","x":1622,"y":269,"width":68,"height":38},{"text":"구성요소는","x":1708,"y":267,"width":162,"height":48}]},{"text":"네트워크 인에서 혼잡 상대와 관련하여 송신자에게 직접적인 피드백을 제공한다","words":[{"text":"네트워크","x":636,"y":332,"width":130,"height":38},{"text":"인에서","x":781,"y":333,"width":94,"height":37},{"text":"혼잡","x":893,"y":330,"width":66,"height":38},{"text":"상대와","x":973,"y":330,"width":101,"height":38},{"text":"관련하여","x":1087,"y":329,"width":132,"height":39},{"text":"송신자에게","x":1237,"y":330,"width":169,"height":39},{"text":"직접적인","x":1427,"y":330,"width":135,"height":38},{"text":"피드백을","x":1581,"y":330,"width":139,"height":39},{"text":"제공한다","x":1736,"y":329,"width":125,"height":46}]},{"text":"이 피드백은 링크의 혼잡을 나타내는 하나의 비트처럼 간단하다. 이 방식은 일찍","words":[{"text":"이","x":633,"y":393,"width":28,"height":38},{"text":"피드백은","x":681,"y":393,"width":132,"height":38},{"text":"링크의","x":829,"y":392,"width":93,"height":39},{"text":"혼잡을","x":939,"y":390,"width":101,"height":38},{"text":"나타내는","x":1055,"y":390,"width":135,"height":39},{"text":"하나의","x":1205,"y":392,"width":99,"height":39},{"text":"비트처럼","x":1325,"y":392,"width":132,"height":39},{"text":"간단하다.","x":1477,"y":392,"width":147,"height":39},{"text":"이","x":1644,"y":392,"width":29,"height":39},{"text":"방식은","x":1694,"y":391,"width":101,"height":40},{"text":"일찍","x":1811,"y":396,"width":53,"height":44}]},{"text":"이 IBM SNA [Schwartz 1982]와 DEC DECnet [Jain 1989; Ramakrishnan","words":[{"text":"이","x":632,"y":454,"width":28,"height":38},{"text":"IBM","x":681,"y":459,"width":71,"height":29},{"text":"SNA","x":771,"y":458,"width":75,"height":30},{"text":"[Schwartz","x":866,"y":456,"width":156,"height":36},{"text":"1982]와","x":1044,"y":453,"width":126,"height":40},{"text":"DEC","x":1186,"y":458,"width":77,"height":30},{"text":"DECnet","x":1283,"y":459,"width":131,"height":30},{"text":"[Jain","x":1434,"y":459,"width":77,"height":36},{"text":"1989;","x":1535,"y":460,"width":88,"height":34},{"text":"Ramakrishnan","x":1645,"y":458,"width":220,"height":41}]},{"text":"199이 구조에서 시용되있고, 최근에 TCP/IP 네트위크[Floyd TCP 1994; RFc","words":[{"text":"199이","x":633,"y":520,"width":84,"height":35},{"text":"구조에서","x":737,"y":514,"width":129,"height":40},{"text":"시용되있고,","x":888,"y":512,"width":174,"height":40},{"text":"최근에","x":1083,"y":514,"width":98,"height":39},{"text":"TCP/IP","x":1200,"y":520,"width":120,"height":30},{"text":"네트위크[Floyd","x":1340,"y":516,"width":245,"height":43},{"text":"TCP","x":1604,"y":522,"width":74,"height":29},{"text":"1994;","x":1702,"y":521,"width":82,"height":34},{"text":"RFc","x":1803,"y":523,"width":63,"height":38}]},{"text":"31681를 위해 제안되었다. 그리고 다음에 논의하는 것처럼, ATM 안에서","words":[{"text":"31681를","x":629,"y":578,"width":135,"height":39},{"text":"위해","x":786,"y":576,"width":64,"height":39},{"text":"제안되었다.","x":876,"y":574,"width":183,"height":40},{"text":"그리고","x":1083,"y":577,"width":107,"height":38},{"text":"다음에","x":1212,"y":578,"width":104,"height":38},{"text":"논의하는","x":1341,"y":579,"width":147,"height":38},{"text":"것처럼,","x":1512,"y":580,"width":118,"height":38},{"text":"ATM","x":1654,"y":584,"width":93,"height":30},{"text":"안에서","x":1771,"y":580,"width":91,"height":49}]},{"text":"ABR(available bit-rate) 혼잡제이로 A卜\u0026된다. 좀 더 자세한 네트워크 피드백 또","words":[{"text":"ABR(available","x":627,"y":642,"width":238,"height":35},{"text":"bit-rate)","x":876,"y":641,"width":133,"height":35},{"text":"혼잡제이로","x":1022,"y":637,"width":170,"height":40},{"text":"A卜\u0026된다.","x":1205,"y":640,"width":144,"height":39},{"text":"좀","x":1364,"y":643,"width":35,"height":35},{"text":"더","x":1414,"y":641,"width":27,"height":38},{"text":"자세한","x":1459,"y":641,"width":105,"height":38},{"text":"네트워크","x":1578,"y":642,"width":138,"height":38},{"text":"피드백","x":1730,"y":643,"width":94,"height":39},{"text":"또","x":1838,"y":653,"width":27,"height":31}]},{"text":"한 기능하다. 예를 들면, 우리가 곧 다를 ATM ABR 혼잡제이의 한 형태는 라우터","words":[{"text":"한","x":628,"y":700,"width":34,"height":37},{"text":"기능하다.","x":674,"y":699,"width":140,"height":40},{"text":"예를","x":829,"y":700,"width":66,"height":38},{"text":"들면,","x":906,"y":698,"width":74,"height":39},{"text":"우리가","x":994,"y":698,"width":102,"height":39},{"text":"곧","x":1107,"y":702,"width":34,"height":35},{"text":"다를","x":1155,"y":700,"width":67,"height":38},{"text":"ATM","x":1234,"y":706,"width":82,"height":28},{"text":"ABR","x":1329,"y":707,"width":80,"height":28},{"text":"혼잡제이의","x":1423,"y":703,"width":171,"height":38},{"text":"한","x":1611,"y":704,"width":36,"height":36},{"text":"형태는","x":1659,"y":704,"width":104,"height":38},{"text":"라우터","x":1777,"y":705,"width":84,"height":45}]},{"text":"자신이 출력 링크(outgoing link)에 제공할 수 있는 전송률을 송신자에게 명확히","words":[{"text":"자신이","x":626,"y":762,"width":97,"height":38},{"text":"출력","x":742,"y":762,"width":63,"height":38},{"text":"링크(outgoing","x":826,"y":762,"width":211,"height":40},{"text":"link)에","x":1054,"y":762,"width":104,"height":39},{"text":"제공할","x":1178,"y":762,"width":102,"height":39},{"text":"수","x":1294,"y":763,"width":35,"height":38},{"text":"있는","x":1347,"y":763,"width":66,"height":38},{"text":"전송률을","x":1431,"y":764,"width":137,"height":37},{"text":"송신자에게","x":1583,"y":765,"width":173,"height":38},{"text":"명확히","x":1777,"y":766,"width":84,"height":45}]},{"text":"알릴 수 있게 해준다. XCP 프로토*[Katabi 2002]은 라우터가 계산하여 피드백","words":[{"text":"알릴","x":626,"y":823,"width":63,"height":38},{"text":"수","x":706,"y":824,"width":35,"height":38},{"text":"있게","x":758,"y":824,"width":62,"height":38},{"text":"해준다.","x":839,"y":823,"width":106,"height":38},{"text":"XCP","x":963,"y":827,"width":73,"height":30},{"text":"프로토*[Katabi","x":1053,"y":826,"width":249,"height":37},{"text":"2002]은","x":1321,"y":825,"width":126,"height":38},{"text":"라우터가","x":1464,"y":824,"width":139,"height":39},{"text":"계산하여","x":1620,"y":826,"width":135,"height":38},{"text":"피드백","x":1776,"y":828,"width":85,"height":43}]},{"text":"을 제공하도록 한다. 즉, 라우터가 각각의 출발지에게 처리하는 패킷의 패킷 헤더","words":[{"text":"을","x":623,"y":885,"width":35,"height":37},{"text":"제공하도록","x":672,"y":885,"width":167,"height":38},{"text":"한다.","x":853,"y":885,"width":74,"height":38},{"text":"즉,","x":943,"y":886,"width":41,"height":37},{"text":"라우터가","x":1002,"y":885,"width":134,"height":38},{"text":"각각의","x":1150,"y":886,"width":97,"height":37},{"text":"출발지에게","x":1264,"y":885,"width":169,"height":38},{"text":"처리하는","x":1453,"y":886,"width":137,"height":38},{"text":"패킷의","x":1606,"y":887,"width":101,"height":37},{"text":"패킷","x":1727,"y":887,"width":63,"height":37},{"text":"헤더","x":1806,"y":890,"width":54,"height":40}]},{"text":"안에 어떻게 출발지의 전송률을 증가시기거나 감소시길 것인지에 관한 정보를 넣","words":[{"text":"안에","x":623,"y":946,"width":64,"height":38},{"text":"어떻게","x":705,"y":946,"width":96,"height":39},{"text":"출발지의","x":818,"y":946,"width":131,"height":38},{"text":"전송률을","x":968,"y":946,"width":134,"height":38},{"text":"증가시기거나","x":1115,"y":947,"width":204,"height":38},{"text":"감소시길","x":1334,"y":946,"width":134,"height":38},{"text":"것인지에","x":1487,"y":947,"width":135,"height":38},{"text":"관한","x":1640,"y":948,"width":71,"height":36},{"text":"정보를","x":1728,"y":948,"width":95,"height":38},{"text":"넣","x":1837,"y":955,"width":22,"height":36}]},{"text":"어 보내는 것이다.","words":[{"text":"어","x":623,"y":1007,"width":28,"height":38},{"text":"보내는","x":667,"y":1007,"width":101,"height":38},{"text":"것이다.","x":782,"y":1007,"width":105,"height":38}]},{"text":"그림 3.49처럼 네트워크 지원 혼잡제어에 대한 혼잡 정보는 전형적인 두 가지 방","words":[{"text":"그림","x":620,"y":1112,"width":63,"height":38},{"text":"3.49처럼","x":700,"y":1113,"width":131,"height":37},{"text":"네트워크","x":851,"y":1113,"width":134,"height":37},{"text":"지원","x":1002,"y":1113,"width":65,"height":37},{"text":"혼잡제어에","x":1082,"y":1113,"width":167,"height":38},{"text":"대한","x":1268,"y":1113,"width":68,"height":37},{"text":"혼잡","x":1349,"y":1112,"width":69,"height":37},{"text":"정보는","x":1434,"y":1113,"width":104,"height":37},{"text":"전형적인","x":1554,"y":1113,"width":137,"height":38},{"text":"두","x":1707,"y":1115,"width":35,"height":36},{"text":"가지","x":1758,"y":1114,"width":59,"height":38},{"text":"방","x":1835,"y":1121,"width":27,"height":36}]},{"text":"법 중 하나로 네트워크에서 송신자에게 피드백된다. 직접 피드백은 네트워크 라우터에","words":[{"text":"법","x":555,"y":1175,"width":28,"height":37},{"text":"중","x":599,"y":1176,"width":35,"height":37},{"text":"하나로","x":645,"y":1174,"width":100,"height":38},{"text":"네트워크에서","x":759,"y":1174,"width":197,"height":38},{"text":"송신자에게","x":973,"y":1174,"width":168,"height":38},{"text":"피드백된다.","x":1158,"y":1173,"width":175,"height":38},{"text":"직접","x":1350,"y":1173,"width":63,"height":38},{"text":"피드백은","x":1432,"y":1173,"width":139,"height":38},{"text":"네트워크","x":1585,"y":1174,"width":138,"height":38},{"text":"라우터에","x":1738,"y":1174,"width":120,"height":44}]},{"text":"서 송신자에게 보내는 것이다. 이 알림의 형태는 전형적으로 초크 패ll(choke packet)","words":[{"text":"서","x":553,"y":1237,"width":29,"height":38},{"text":"송신자에게","x":598,"y":1235,"width":166,"height":40},{"text":"보내는","x":779,"y":1235,"width":103,"height":38},{"text":"것이다.","x":897,"y":1235,"width":106,"height":38},{"text":"이","x":1021,"y":1235,"width":28,"height":38},{"text":"알림의","x":1068,"y":1235,"width":97,"height":37},{"text":"형태는","x":1183,"y":1235,"width":102,"height":38},{"text":"전형적으로","x":1299,"y":1234,"width":170,"height":38},{"text":"초크","x":1483,"y":1237,"width":70,"height":29},{"text":"패ll(choke","x":1569,"y":1235,"width":176,"height":39},{"text":"packet)","x":1759,"y":1243,"width":102,"height":38}]},{"text":"의 형태를 갖는다. 즉, “나는 혼잡하다!”라고 말하는 것이다. 알림의 두 번째 형태는 라","words":[{"text":"의","x":553,"y":1299,"width":29,"height":38},{"text":"형태를","x":599,"y":1297,"width":100,"height":39},{"text":"갖는다.","x":712,"y":1297,"width":107,"height":38},{"text":"즉,","x":834,"y":1298,"width":42,"height":36},{"text":"“나는","x":891,"y":1296,"width":81,"height":38},{"text":"혼잡하다!”라고","x":985,"y":1296,"width":231,"height":37},{"text":"말하는","x":1230,"y":1296,"width":102,"height":37},{"text":"것이다.","x":1347,"y":1295,"width":108,"height":38},{"text":"알림의","x":1473,"y":1295,"width":100,"height":38},{"text":"두","x":1590,"y":1298,"width":36,"height":35},{"text":"번째","x":1642,"y":1296,"width":64,"height":37},{"text":"형태는","x":1724,"y":1296,"width":98,"height":39},{"text":"라","x":1834,"y":1304,"width":27,"height":36}]},{"text":"우터가 혼잡을 나타내기 위해 송신자에서 수신자에게 흐르는 패킷 안의 특정 필드에","words":[{"text":"우터가","x":552,"y":1360,"width":101,"height":39},{"text":"혼잡을","x":667,"y":1359,"width":101,"height":37},{"text":"나타내기","x":784,"y":1357,"width":129,"height":39},{"text":"위해","x":935,"y":1357,"width":64,"height":37},{"text":"송신자에서","x":1017,"y":1357,"width":166,"height":38},{"text":"수신자에게","x":1203,"y":1356,"width":168,"height":38},{"text":"흐르는","x":1390,"y":1358,"width":105,"height":35},{"text":"패킷","x":1512,"y":1357,"width":67,"height":37},{"text":"안의","x":1599,"y":1357,"width":65,"height":37},{"text":"특정","x":1684,"y":1358,"width":65,"height":36},{"text":"필드에","x":1771,"y":1358,"width":86,"height":44}]},{"text":"표시/수정하여 표시한다. 이 표시된 패킷을 수신했을 때, 수신자는 혼잡 상태를 송신자","words":[{"text":"표시/수정하여","x":552,"y":1420,"width":206,"height":39},{"text":"표시한다.","x":774,"y":1418,"width":142,"height":39},{"text":"이","x":933,"y":1418,"width":28,"height":37},{"text":"표시된","x":977,"y":1417,"width":101,"height":37},{"text":"패킷을","x":1094,"y":1418,"width":101,"height":36},{"text":"수신했을","x":1207,"y":1417,"width":138,"height":37},{"text":"때,","x":1359,"y":1417,"width":40,"height":38},{"text":"수신자는","x":1414,"y":1417,"width":141,"height":37},{"text":"혼잡","x":1567,"y":1418,"width":72,"height":37},{"text":"상태를","x":1651,"y":1418,"width":105,"height":37},{"text":"송신자","x":1769,"y":1419,"width":91,"height":43}]},{"text":"에게 알린다. 후자 형태의 알림은 완전한 왕복시간이 걸린다는 것에 유의해야 한다.","words":[{"text":"에게","x":552,"y":1483,"width":63,"height":37},{"text":"알린다.","x":631,"y":1482,"width":105,"height":37},{"text":"후자","x":751,"y":1481,"width":67,"height":37},{"text":"형태의","x":831,"y":1479,"width":96,"height":38},{"text":"알림은","x":943,"y":1478,"width":101,"height":37},{"text":"완전한","x":1056,"y":1477,"width":103,"height":37},{"text":"왕복시간이","x":1170,"y":1477,"width":168,"height":37},{"text":"걸린다는","x":1356,"y":1478,"width":137,"height":37},{"text":"것에","x":1507,"y":1478,"width":66,"height":37},{"text":"유의해야","x":1588,"y":1479,"width":142,"height":37},{"text":"한다.","x":1741,"y":1479,"width":72,"height":39}]},{"text":"호 드 A","words":[{"text":"호","x":560,"y":1669,"width":24,"height":24},{"text":"드","x":616,"y":1671,"width":20,"height":15},{"text":"A","x":647,"y":1669,"width":22,"height":23}]},{"text":"수신入를 경유하는 네트워크 피드백","words":[{"text":"수신入를","x":1007,"y":1705,"width":106,"height":29},{"text":"경유하는","x":1124,"y":1703,"width":105,"height":31},{"text":"네트워크","x":1240,"y":1704,"width":106,"height":29},{"text":"피드백","x":1356,"y":1705,"width":80,"height":29}]},{"text":"직접적인","words":[{"text":"직접적인","x":1186,"y":1826,"width":105,"height":30}]},{"text":"네트워크 피드백","words":[{"text":"네트워크","x":1142,"y":1866,"width":105,"height":30},{"text":"피드백","x":1257,"y":1867,"width":79,"height":29}]},{"text":"그림 3.49 • 네트워크 지원 혼잡 정보를 위한 2개의 피드백 경로","words":[{"text":"그림","x":536,"y":2374,"width":54,"height"